---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Projects | Rohith Kumar Tappa">
  <div class="card hero">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p>
      A few projects that show how I approach problem framing, modeling, and delivery.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid two section">

    <section class="card col-7">
      <h2>PreAuth.ai: Prior Authorization Risk Assistant</h2>
      <p>
        Built an end-to-end Dify workflow on Claude Sonnet that extracts fields from prior authorization packets, retrieves UnitedHealthcare policy context through RAG, and returns JSON denial-risk scores with fixes.
      </p>

      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">Claude API</span>
        <span class="badge">RAG</span>
        <span class="badge">Dify</span>
        <span class="badge">Python</span>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Automated policy ingestion with Python pipeline syncing PDFs to Dify knowledge base with automatic chunking &amp; incremental upload logging.</p>
      <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Dify, Claude Sonnet, Python, RAG, PDF processing, JSON schema enforcement</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact">See Demo</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card col-5">
      <h2>Stanley Black &amp; Decker Power BI Framework</h2>
      <p>
        Classified 88,314 products across 356 product lines into five structural bill-of-materials (BOM) tiers, isolating 1,284 products with SKU nesting issues.
      </p>

      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">Power BI</span>
        <span class="badge">DAX</span>
        <span class="badge">ETL</span>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Engineered repeatable Power Query pipeline, optimized 535 export files through CSV conversion.</p>
      <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Power BI, DAX, Power Query, Excel, Data Modeling</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact">Internship Details</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card col-7">
      <h2>Forge Analytics: Campus Police Crime Database</h2>
      <p>
        Designed entity-relationship diagram and relational schema with 8 tables &amp; 20 business rules. Co-wrote SQL queries for comprehensive crime and arrest analytics.
      </p>

      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">SQL</span>
        <span class="badge">Database Design</span>
        <span class="badge">Data Modeling</span>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <p><strong>Focus:</strong> ER diagram design, normalization, and query optimization for law enforcement analytics.</p>
      <p><strong>Stack:</strong> SQL, Database Design, Business Analysis</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact">Project Details</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card col-5">
      <h2>North Peak Coffee Store Analysis</h2>
      <p>
        Built three-dashboard Tableau Story showing growth trends: store count +33%, revenue per store +5%, drive-thru outperformance (+40% in small cities).
      </p>

      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">Tableau</span>
        <span class="badge">Data Viz</span>
        <span class="badge">Analytics</span>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Actionable insights on store expansion strategy and channel performance.</p>
      <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Tableau, Data Analysis, Business Intelligence</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/rohith.kumar.tappa/viz/FinalProjectDeliverable_17922036281800/NorthPeeK-growthformatandwheretoexpand" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card col-12">
      <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
      <p>
        I'm actively seeking full-time roles or internships in Data Analytics, Product Management, AI Engineering, or Digital Transformation. Let's build something impactful together.
      </p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact">Get in Touch</a>
        <a class="button" href="/">Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
